# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Qualcomm QAIRT SDK -- proprietary, redistributed only under the SDK licence.
# Both are required to build/run and neither may ever be committed.
# See docs/05-licensing.md.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
android/src/main/jniLibs/
android/src/main/cpp/include/QNN/

# Model weights and converted context binaries. GPL-3.0 / Non-Commercial /
# ResearchRAIL -- see docs/04-models.md. Downloaded at runtime, never bundled.
*.bin
models/

# Release signing. NOT recoverable -- back the keystore up somewhere safe.
# Losing it means never being able to update an installed app again.
*.jks
*.keystore
keystore.properties

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Working notes -- kept on disk, kept OUT of the repository.
#
# CLAUDE.md and docs/ are the engineering record: current state, measured numbers,
# decisions, open licence questions and session history. They stay complete and
# current LOCALLY -- they are how the next session picks the work up -- but they
# are not the public face of the project, and they carry personal details (device,
# machine paths) and unresolved legal questions that do not belong in a public repo.
#
# README.md is the EXCEPTION and is tracked: it is the public face, written for
# someone finding this package cold. See docs/plan -> Phase 10.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
CLAUDE.md
docs/
notes/

# Secrets. Nothing here is ever committed (see CLAUDE.md rule 2).
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
